---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Team"
  description="Meet Peter and Hayley, the small founding team behind New Earth and its connected technology, practical living and community-focused work."
  canonical="/team/"
>
  <article class="team-page">
    <header class="team-hero shell">
      <div class="team-hero__copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">People behind New Earth</p>
        <h1>The people behind New Earth</h1>
        <p class="lede">New Earth is being built by a small founding team, with different but connected areas of focus.</p>
        <p>Peter and Hayley bring practical systems, conscious living and the human questions around both into one wider New Earth direction.</p>
      </div>
      <figure class="team-portrait">
        <img src="/assets/peter_hayley_team.webp" width="960" height="1200" alt="Peter and Hayley, the people behind New Earth." loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" />
        <figcaption>Peter Ellis and Hayley</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </header>

    <div class="team-body shell">
      <section class="team-introduction" aria-labelledby="team-focus-title">
        <p class="eyebrow">Different areas, shared direction</p>
        <h2 id="team-focus-title">Two connected areas of focus</h2>
        <p>Peter and Hayley do not hold identical roles. Each brings a different emphasis to the work, while both contribute to the wider New Earth framework and its practical expression.</p>
      </section>

      <div class="team-profiles">
        <article class="team-profile team-profile--peter">
          <p class="team-profile__role">Founder / Builder</p>
          <h2>Peter Ellis</h2>
          <p>Peter focuses on New Earth systems, technology, engineering, MicroGrow, local AI, practical projects and the wider ecosystem architecture.</p>
          <nav class="team-profile__links" aria-label="Explore Peter's work">
            <a class="text-link" href="/founders-journey/">Read Peter's Founder's Journey</a>
            <a class="text-link" href="/projects/">Explore Projects</a>
          </nav>
        </article>

        <article class="team-profile team-profile--hayley">
          <p class="team-profile__role">Co-founder / Conscious Living</p>
          <h2>Hayley</h2>
          <p>Hayley focuses on New Earth Conscious Living, wellbeing, practical living, accessible guidance and the human side of New Earth.</p>
          <nav class="team-profile__links" aria-label="Explore related practical context">
            <a class="text-link" href="/new-earth-in-practice/">Explore New Earth in Practice</a>
          </nav>
        </article>
      </div>

      <aside class="team-company" aria-labelledby="team-company-title">
        <p class="eyebrow">Company context</p>
        <h2 id="team-company-title">Selected work within the wider framework</h2>
        <p>New Earth Advanced Technologies Ltd supports selected New Earth technology, engineering and product development within the wider New Earth framework.</p>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .team-page { padding-bottom: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 8rem); }
  .team-hero { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.05fr) minmax(320px, .75fr); gap: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 6rem); align-items: center; padding-block: clamp(4rem, 9vw, 7rem); }
  .team-hero__copy { max-width: 690px; }
  .team-hero__copy h1 { max-width: 12ch; }
  .team-hero__copy > p:last-child { max-width: 61ch; }
  .team-portrait { width: min(100%, 470px); margin: 0; justify-self: end; }
  .team-portrait img { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); background: var(--sage); box-shadow: var(--shadow); }
  .team-portrait figcaption { margin-top: .7rem; color: var(--forest); font-size: .9rem; }
  .team-body { max-width: 1060px; }
  .team-introduction { max-width: 720px; padding-block: clamp(2.75rem, 5vw, 4rem); border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .team-introduction h2 { max-width: 16ch; }
  .team-introduction > p:last-child { max-width: 67ch; }
  .team-profiles { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; }
  .team-profile { min-width: 0; padding: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2.25rem); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-top: 3px solid var(--gold); border-radius: var(--radius); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ivory) 86%, var(--sage)); }
  .team-profile--hayley { border-top-color: var(--forest); }
  .team-profile__role { margin: 0 0 .45rem; color: var(--forest); font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .team-profile h2 { margin-bottom: .8rem; }
  .team-profile p:not(.team-profile__role) { max-width: 55ch; }
  .team-profile__links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .55rem 1.25rem; margin-top: 1.25rem; }
  .team-profile__links a { display: inline-flex; min-height: 44px; align-items: center; }
  .team-company { max-width: 800px; margin-top: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem); padding: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2.25rem); border-left: 4px solid var(--line); background: var(--sage); }
  .team-company h2 { max-width: 19ch; font-size: clamp(1.65rem, 3vw, 2.35rem); }
  .team-company p:last-child { max-width: 68ch; margin-bottom: 0; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .team-hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .team-portrait { width: min(100%, 520px); justify-self: start; } .team-profiles { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  @media (max-width: 480px) { .team-hero { gap: 2rem; padding-block: 3.5rem; } .team-profile, .team-company { padding: 1.35rem; } }
</style>
